{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What each Origami patch becomes in SwiftUI, so you know which construct — or which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" helper — to reach for."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch graph and SwiftUI both describe how values flow and change over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"time, so the translations map onto SwiftUI’s own tools: computed properties for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pure math, gestures and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" for interaction, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withAnimation"},{"type":"text","text":" for motion. Most"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patches land on a native SwiftUI construct. A few need a helper from the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library, named after the patch it stands in for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Patch → SwiftUI","anchor":"Patch-%E2%86%92-SwiftUI","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami patch","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftUI","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pure value patch (Add, interpolate, logic)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"computed property \/ expression (native)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Interaction (Tap, Press, Double Tap, Long Press)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"gesture + ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","